[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    229[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### 2.8 Control flow
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    230[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    231[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * C `for (init; cond; step)` -> Rust `while` loop with the step at the end
